	(text "1. USB7206C  USB 3.2 Gen2 hub, VQFN-100 12x12 (EP = VSS, via array to GND planes)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d67fdb2a-7150-5a11-bb6a-b0a9c498c82a")
	)
	(text "2. HUB TX AC-COUPLING  220 nF 0402 X7R in series with every hub SS TX (upstream + 5 downstream)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f7cba7ea-d51a-5ce3-a2d1-033e5f0d2d19")
	)
	(text "Hub RX pairs have no caps here: the transmitting chip's side (TUSB1064/TUSB1046/GL3224/RTL8156/USB-A sheet) provides them."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7f23c40f-43be-50f8-8a74-f647cbea8a02")
	)
	(text "Place caps within ~5 mm of the hub pins, symmetric per pair, cut the reference plane under the 0402 pads (L2 void) for 10G."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9a0fa03b-ae73-5c7b-aef6-3485e8573a67")
	)
	(text "3. DECOUPLING  VDD33 x8 pins, VCORE x9 pins: 100 nF per pin at the pin, plus 4.7 uF + 1 nF per rail (DS fig. 4-1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 254.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3c979a50-0d4b-5b9a-85ab-28cc56d72349")
	)
	(text "VCORE ~1.31 A (10G upstream + 5x 10G ports: 410 + 5*179 mA), VDD33 ~0.09 A -> ~1.8 W total; theta-JA 19 C/W (2S2P) -> ~+35 K."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 304.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4614e450-301a-5013-8f7a-7f001a19a7f8")
	)
	(text "+1V15 bulk 4x22 uF sits at the TPS62933P (power_rails); route +1V15 as a pour on L4 under the hub."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 307.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "60a52701-c6d8-5f86-ae45-28b06c0139e0")
	)
	(text "4. CLOCK / BIAS / TEST / STRAPS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b8510371-5686-5687-874a-6041d410d649")
	)
	(text "Straps are latched at POR / RESET_N rising edge (hold >= 1 ms after). Config 3 (STRAP2 200k PD, STRAP1 10k PD) is the"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 93.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "26cd5053-4e31-55d7-b7a8-59b9e9f2362c")
	)
	(text "only valid USB7206C mode: PF26/27 = SMBus slave, PF15/16 = PRT_CTL3/2, PF30 = VBUS_DET, PF18/31 = I2C master (unused)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d8bd5e7c-7120-5326-8730-0d64031a94e8")
	)
	(text "PF3-7 (I2S), PF18/31 (I2C master), PF19 (MIC_DET), PF29 (GPIO93): unused -> 100k PD.  PF8/9 NC.  PRT_CTL1/4/5/6 float."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 99.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fa2c93a9-aa8b-5fe1-a31a-fcab613b778f")
	)
	(text "CFG_NON_REM 200k PU = port 1 non-removable; CFG_BC_EN 10k PU = BC1.2 on ports 1-3. RP2350 refines both over SMBus"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "40792462-8d3f-5072-9be1-c382b92a4fa4")
	)
	(text "(non-removable 1/4/6, BC on 2/3 only) when it is alive; with the RP2350 dead the strap defaults are safe."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f00ca033-c546-51b3-8175-1bd9598eb0c6")
	)
	(text "5. RESET / VBUS_DET / SMBUS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "efb21acf-47c3-58b6-9f3e-671016debb86")
	)
	(text "RESET_N = HUB_RESET_N (RP2350 open-drain) AND RAILS_PG (TPS62933P PG, open drain, 100k on power_rails) via D601."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bb6afcab-97cb-5f55-84a8-12a48cbdf9dc")
	)
	(text "  Hub held in standby until +1V15 is in regulation (implies +3V3 up); 10k pull-up then releases it. trst >= 5 us."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4080a11b-fa1d-5dbd-84ba-fff7ddb04551")
	)
	(text "VBUS_DET (PF30): VBUS_LAPTOP -> 47k/68k (x0.591) + BAT54WS clamp to +3V3 -> HUB_VBUS_SNS -> 74LVC1G17 (+3V3, Schmitt,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a795d4ea-a79c-590a-b00b-8685773476b7")
	)
	(text "  5.5 V-tolerant input) -> 15k/49.9k -> PF30.  Sense node: 4.4 V -> 2.60 V (> VT+ max 2.0 V), 28 V -> ~3.6 V clamp (OK for"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9c8884ea-2948-5767-a347-738f98b3ebf8")
	)
	(text "  the LVC input), vSafe0V 0.8 V -> 0.47 V (< VT- min 0.8 V). PF30 high = +3V3 x 0.769 = 2.46-2.64 V for +3V3 3.20-3.43 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 187.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d567ef26-84b3-5905-898c-19ab1bb42cab")
	)
	(text "  (<= 2.7 V checklist 5.1, > VIH 2.1 V); 11k/49.9k from the checklist would give 2.73 V at our 3.33 V rail -> 15k."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8bb8cb4e-ea96-5bb5-a10e-1b25814ff7ae")
	)
	(text "  Buffer powered from +3V3 = same rail as VDD33 -> VBUS_DET can never rise before VDD33."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 193.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aa372781-720f-560a-8e1d-8012dbe95ae9")
	)
	(text "  VBUS present = laptop attached (deck sources VBUS only after attach). Limitation (review data #6): VBUS also exists for"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8d7b84ef-36ed-5fb1-9d04-7b992a258989")
	)
	(text "  a powered-off laptop / charge-only cable -> hub waits as CDP, USB-A get no VBUS until FORCE_EN (firmware)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d51d9017-0b81-502f-a2ee-1e47a5496024")
	)
	(text "  VBUS_DET = 0 (no laptop): BC1.2 ports run as DCP; VBUS_DET = 1: CDP once the host powers the port."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "74d3ee52-5163-59f8-8f9e-2db5477aecfb")
	)
	(text "SMBus slave addr 0x2D. Pull-ups only when HUB_SMB_PU (RP2350 GPIO) is high -> hub enters CFG_SMBUS and waits for"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b9352b38-c0da-5e32-9e50-a507625e552a")
	)
	(text "  the RP2350's config + USB_ATTACH_WITH_SMBUS (AA56h). HUB_SMB_PU low/floating (RP2350 off, BOOTSEL, broken FW):"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6119d7dc-5730-597a-b72c-45b13cf6252f")
	)
	(text "  no pull-ups seen -> hub boots from ROM+straps+OTP immediately -> RP2350 BOOTSEL (UF2) still enumerates on port 6."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 208.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e2c63225-e75e-5969-87c6-96ad2373c3fa")
	)
	(text "  Firmware: SMB_PU high -> RESET_N low >= 5 us -> release -> wait >= 40 ms -> config -> AA56h. No other pull-ups on this bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 210.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "684daf4f-57b8-59cc-b96e-afbfdad29ca0")
	)
	(text "6. USB-A PORT POWER  PRT_CTLx = combined power-enable output + overcurrent input (DS 8.2)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0a9a350f-019c-5595-baa1-6bd4afecf5d0")
	)
	(text "USB-A #1 = hub port 2 (PRT_CTL2, PF16), USB-A #2 = hub port 3 (PRT_CTL3, PF15). Port on: pin = input + internal ~50k"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 266.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "713d16a6-0069-5813-8d42-acd07c78d76e")
	)
	(text "  pull-up (EN high), switch FAULT# (open drain) pulls it low = overcurrent; port off: hub drives it low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 269.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e8a4ac65-f98f-51e1-a0e3-5ba17a8cf7d9")
	)
	(text "  USBAx_PWR_EN and USBAx_OCS_N are therefore the SAME node (0R ties, R630/R631). Do NOT add an external pull-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 271.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "40b81e19-19b0-5928-8bcc-50297bc03b1c")
	)
	(text "  usb_a sheet: TPS2553 EN = PWR_EN OR FORCE_EN (gate input, high-Z), FAULT# open-drain -> OCS_N."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 274.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
